{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月20日，受全球AI概念股拋售潮影響，軟銀集團股價一度暴跌超15%，至3005日元，創今年4月初以來最低水平，幾乎抹去年內由AI投資熱潮推動的全部漲幅。隨着市場對AI巨額資本開支的長期回報產生質疑，軟銀龐大的AI投資組合正面臨嚴峻考驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587252.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.305737+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_hash":"f761798d2dd2da108cc46db478dce2eeb66087a247e9e386256abf09d15c0ba1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}